Zero point energy                ...      0.19245172 Eh     120.77 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00783801 Eh       4.92 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
